      <description>&lt;h1 id=&#34;named-by-ai-由人工智能命名&#34;&gt;Named by AI ✨ 由人工智能✨命名&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Behold! Enchanting baby names we&amp;rsquo;ve found just for you:&lt;br&gt;&#xA;看！我们为您找到的迷人婴儿名字：&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Asher: Derived from the Hebrew word for &amp;ldquo;happy&amp;rdquo; or &amp;ldquo;blessed,&amp;rdquo; Asher is a celestial-inspired name often associated with the stars. It has a friendly and approachable feel and can be shortened to Ash or Ashy.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
